Z||000003||Raydar||05-31-2001||01:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>...GD Wake County won't pass your car if you've got a decal on the windshield!!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> Stupid b*stards!!!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I would ask if you're kidding, but I'm sure you're not.<P>We are at the other extreme. You can drive down the road here, shedding parts as you go, and nobody cares as long as your car has "fresh breath."  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 Duke coupe <BR>88 "wadded up" Formula (parts car)||||reg||1
Z||000004||kslish||05-31-2001||03:49 PM||||My GT is at the inspection station today getting it's "emissions exempt" inspection sticker.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>In a way I'm glad that PA has annual safety inspections though, considering some of the junk I see driving along the highway from across the border in Ohio.  Gotta love those pickup trucks with the fenders rusted so thin that they are flapping in the wind....<P>Ken S.||||reg||1
Z||000005||LZeitgeist||05-31-2001||07:39 PM||||Raydar - <P>Nope, I'm dead serious. I've got a "Formula" logo (just like on the doors, but larger and curved to match the top of the windshield) up there, and you can see *through* the letters, just like on the door logo - but because it's up there, and you can't see *through* the 1/4"-wide strips of vinyl, it won't pass the 'window tint' specs of 35% light transmission.  <P>You can see through the letters and around the vinyl! You don't have to see *through* the vinyl!!! It doesn't block anything!! Argh!!! <P>I had to scrape it off completely before they'd pass my inspection. When I got the first one, though, I got a second one... I guess I'll just have to plan on putting a new one on every year I own the car for the rest of my life....   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P><BR>Stupid, stupid Wake County inspection BS......<P>EDIT: typos<p>[This message has been edited by LZeitgeist (edited 05-31-2001).]||||reg||1
